      hu: ["Azerbajdzsán legnagyobb mogyorótermelője.", "A Zaqatala-erőd a 19. században épült.", "Számos etnikai kisebbség, köztük az avarok otthona."],
      ro: ["Cel mai mare producător de alune din Azerbaidjan.", "Cetatea Zagatala a fost construită în secolul al XIX-lea.", "Găzduiește multe minorități etnice, precum avarii."],
      en: ["Largest producer of hazelnuts in Azerbaijan.", "The Zaqatala Fortress was built in the 19th century.", "Home to many ethnic minorities such as the Avars."]
