      en: ["Population: approx. 14,000 (2020)", "Historic capital of Caucasian Albania (1st-6th c.)", "Elevation: 800 m above sea level", "Ski resort: Tufandag, opened 2018", "Distance to Baku: about 220 km", "Archaeological museum founded 1985"],
